Coin 3 produces multiples of 3: 3, 6, 9, 12, 15, etc.<br />
Coin 6 produces multiples of 6: 6, 12, 18, 24, etc.<br />
Coin 9 produces multiples of 9: 9, 18, 27, 36, etc.<br />
All of the coins combined produce: 3, 6, <u>9</u>, 12, 15, etc.
